list this repository's worktrees, or every registered worktree outside a
repository

Usage:
  treerig worktree list [flags]

Flags:
      --all             every repository and domain on this machine
      --config string   path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above cwd, if
                        any)
  -h, --help            help for list
      --json            machine-readable output

Global Flags:
      --progress mode   how to show progress: auto or plain (one line per
                        change) (default "auto")
